message: "If you use Open Media, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "Open Media"
abstract: >-
  Open-source app that brings your social world together: one feed across
  Open Media, Farcaster, Lens, Hive and DeSo, one inbox, one post to every
  network, plus a professional side for profiles, jobs and networking (JSON
  Resume). Agent-ready: public API, MCP servers, WebMCP, and a plugin for
  Claude Code and Codex.
authors:
